Subject: [PATCH] Keep prop discovery active in larger Skyloft actor trees

---
 runtime/hle/sst_prop_bridge.h | 75 ++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 runtime/hle/sst_prop_walk.h   | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)
